\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 \u8220 Postmedia\u8217 s fourth quarter results mark the conclusion of a year that has seen growth\u8239 and strategic progress in spite continued challenges in Canada\u8217 s domestic media sector,\u8221  said Andrew MacLeod,\u8239 Postmedia President and Chief Executive Officer. \u8220 Gains across advertising,\u8239 circulation and parcel delivery demonstrate our strategy is working, but the accelerated disruptions in digital audience due to Google\u8217 s\u8239 roll out of A.I reinforce the criticality of continued transformation.\u8221 }
